        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMGR44-FMT, Single Cylinder Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Farmington Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Maguire Handleset with Farmington Lever is exactly what your traditional styled home needs. As a front door lock, the Single Cylinder Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Farmington Lever not only delivers impeccable security features, it also has style. The Farmington Lever is one of the most used styles of door levers and for good reason. You don't mess with a classic. The same is true for the oval shape of the Maguire Entry Set. The Yale Expressions Maguire Entrance Handleset will fit many pre-drilled doors that are a standard thickness from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Expressions Maguire Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-1/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMGR44-FMT-specifications.pdf?v=1704262434\"><b>Yale YMGR44-FMT Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
